    "title": "The Fire Hose of Falsehood - NewsBreak",
    "text": "18 hours ago Christopher Paul and Mariam Matthews of Rand Corporation studied how certain political movements use lies, intentionally, as persuasive weapons. They found their goal in lying is not necessarily to win an argument; rather it is to make truth feel impossible to find. They entitled their report “The Fire Hose of Falsehood.” While based on the Russian Propaganda Model, aren’t its’ findings equally applicable to our destructive politics since 2015? Read full article",
